---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Map as Web map page<br/>Leaflet (react-leaflet)
    participant Cache as Browser tile cache<br/>(proposed)
    participant Tiles as Tile server<br/>OpenStreetMap today

    Note over Steward,Tiles: Covers US 4.0.2 (MoSCoW: Would Like But Won't Get). Platform: web,<br/>as the client said on Sep 25. "(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Steward->>Map: Select an area and Download for offline use (proposed)
    Map->>Map: List tiles for the area and zoom levels (proposed)
    loop Each tile in the area
        Map->>Tiles: GET tile
        alt Tile is received
            Tiles-->>Map: Tile image
            Map->>Cache: Store tile with area name (proposed)
        else Request fails
            Map->>Map: Count failed tile
        end
    end
    Map-->>Steward: Show download status: complete,<br/>or partial with number of failed tiles (AT 1)

    alt Device is online (AT 4)
        Steward->>Map: Pan or zoom
        Map->>Tiles: GET live tiles
        Tiles-->>Map: Tiles
        Map-->>Steward: Show live map. The cache is not used
    else Device is offline (AT 2, AT 3)
        Steward->>Map: Pan or zoom
        Map->>Cache: Get tiles (proposed)
        alt Tiles are inside a downloaded area
            Cache-->>Map: Cached tiles
            Map-->>Steward: Show map. Pan and zoom work
        else Tiles are outside all downloaded areas
            Cache-->>Map: No tile
            Map-->>Steward: Show a "not downloaded" mark<br/>on each missing tile
        end
    end

    Note over Map,Tiles: The web page must also open with no network.<br/>Today middleware.ts calls Supabase Auth on each request.
